What this is

I'm working through the AWS Generative AI Developer material and sharing what I learn as I go. I'm not teaching a course — I'm summarising the topics I covered and explaining them in my own words, which is the fastest way I know to find out whether I actually understood something.

This block was about agents — AI that does things rather than just answering — and then about making any of it survive real users and a real budget.

